# Line endings: store every text file as LF, and check it out as LF on every
# platform (Windows included). Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` checks the
# LF-committed markdown out as CRLF on Windows, so `prettier`/`git` see
# hundreds of files as "modified" and `format:check` disagrees with CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize, never diff as text.
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
